    "title": "'Pumpkin Patch': Nacogdoches shelter offers free orange cat adoptions - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Meredith Billings ,\n5 hours ago NACOGDOCHES, Texas (KLTV) - In true fall-spirit, a Nacogdoches animal shelter is hosting an ‘Orange Cat Pumkin Patch’ adoption event through the rest of October. “We seem to be gathering a collection of cute, ORANGE cats around these parts!” the Nacogdoches Animal Services & Adoption Center said in a post. “Orange female cats aren’t as common as males but we happen to have TWO here at the shelter right now!” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
